SUMMARY:Join CSCE U of T & UT-ITE for WSP Industry Night
DESCRIPTION:Join CSCE U of T & UT-ITE for WSP Industry Night! \n\nThe Canadian Society for Civil Engineering U of T Student Chapter and the University of Toronto Institute of Transportation Engineers present WSP Industry Night. \nMonday\, November 23\, 2026  |  6-7 p.m.  |  GB244 – Galbraith Building \nThis exclusive event will highlight WSP’s Transportation and Infrastructure division\, including rail and transit\, aviation\, ports\, and marine. Students will have the opportunity to learn about WSP’s projects\, explore potential career opportunities\, and connect with industry professionals. \nWhether you’re interested in transportation engineering or exploring career opportunities in the industry\, this is a great chance to gain valuable insights and expand your professional network! \nRSVP link
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/join-csce-u-of-t-ut-ite-for-wsp-industry-night/
CATEGORIES:Info sessions
END:VEVENT
