SUMMARY:Clarke Prize Application Deadline
DESCRIPTION:The Clarke Prize Environmental Design Challenge\nThe Clarke Prize Environmental Design Challenge is a three-day event exclusively for undergraduate engineering students (year 2+). Put your creativity and problem-solving skills to the test as you come up with new ideas to tackle real-world environmental challenges. Collaborate with peers\, learn from experts and turn your innovative ideas into impactful solutions. \nParticipants engage in a cumulative design pitch and proposal before a panel of judges with a top prize of $10\,000\, second-place prize of $7\,000 and a third-place prize of $5\,000. \nApplications for the January 2027 Clarke Prize Environmental Design Challenge are open from October 19\, 2026 – November 25\, 2026. \nLearn more about this design challenge and apply today!
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/clarke-prize-application-deadline/
END:VEVENT
