SUMMARY:Exam Prep with engSuccess Mentors (Practice\, Strategies\, Tips)
DESCRIPTION:Exam Prep in Action with engSuccess Mentors (Practice\, Strategies\, Tips)\nEver walked into an exam feeling underprepared\, unsure how to manage your time\, or wondering how to tackle the questions? You are not alone. But with the right preparation strategies and practice\, you can approach exams with greater confidence. \nJoin engSuccess Mentors for an interactive exam preparation session where you will learn how to: \n\nPractice with a real exam under timed conditions\nChoose an exam and experience what it feels like to work within the allotted time\nManage your time effectively and prioritize questions during an exam\nLearn practical strategies to prepare smarter and study more effectively\nGet tips and advice from engSuccess Mentors on what to do before\, during\, and after an exam\n\nThe key to exam success is not just studying harder but preparing smarter. \nThis session is your opportunity to put your skills to the test\, learn from the experience\, and discover strategies to help you feel more prepared and confident on exam day. \n  \nThis workshop is about exam preparation:\nDate: Thursday\, December 3th at 6:00 – 9:00 PM\nOpen to all undergraduate engineering students \nRegistration
URL:https://www.engineering.utoronto.ca/event/exam-prep-with-engsuccess-mentors-practice-strategies-tips/
CATEGORIES:Lectures, seminars and workshops
END:VEVENT
